SOURCE-private  (do NOT upload this folder)
- index.source.html : your readable, editable page (keep as backup)
- build.js          : turns index.source.html into the protected war-shop-site/index.html
                      (node + esbuild: strips every comment, minifies HTML/CSS/JS)
Upload ONLY the war-shop-site folder to Netlify.
After each edit: run: npm i esbuild  then  node build.js index.source.html ../war-shop-site/index.html
